anaka/cake_ptbr/tree/3.0) that has some files for L10n and I18n of Cake in Pt_BR.\n\nOne of these files is [inflections.php](https://github.com/pedro-stanaka/cake_ptbr/blob/3.0/config%2Finflections.php) which add new rules of plural and etc for brazilian portuguese.\nThe problem that is occurring to me is that I require this file in my test bootstrap and when I try to run my tests concerning about Inflections all the assertions about irregulars plurals/singulars present failures.\n\n``` php\n\n<?php\n\n    /**\n     * teste plural irregular\n     * @return void\n     */\n    private function testPluralIrregular()\n    {\n        $this->assertEquals('Alemaes', Inflector::pluralize('Alemao'));\n        $this->assertEquals('Maos', Inflector::pluralize('Mao'));\n        $this->assertEquals('Caes', Inflector::pluralize('Cao'));\n        $this->assertEquals('Repteis', Inflector::pluralize('Reptil'),);\n        $this->assertEquals('Sotaos', Inflector::pluralize('Sotao'));\n        $this->assertEquals('Paises', Inflector::pluralize('Pais'));\n        $this->assertEquals('Pais', Inflector::pluralize('Pai'));\n    }\n```\n\nAm I doing something wrong or this is a bug in Inflector class?\n","closed_by":{"login":"pedro-stanaka","id":2609731,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDk3MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2609731?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka","html_url":"https://github.com/pedro-stanaka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedro-stanaka/repos","events_url":"h